[en.FOCUS_C15_ECONOMIC_LEFTOVER]
Historical Leftover

[en.FOCUS_C15_ECONOMIC_LEFTOVER_desc]
Of course, in the process of the making the Crystal Empire great again, the historical leftover has become an obstacle that can no longer be bypassed - the issue of the Pact, and the relationship with the changelings.

[zh.FOCUS_C15_ECONOMIC_LEFTOVER]
历史遗留问题

[zh.FOCUS_C15_ECONOMIC_LEFTOVER_desc]
然而，在水晶帝国复兴的路途中，解决历史遗留问题成为了不可绕开的障碍——关于《协定》和与幻形灵的关系问题。

